<span typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Kati=
p%C5%8D,_Birdlings_Flat_7591,_New_Zealand_imported_from_iNaturalist_photo_3=
73793836.jpg" class=3D"mw-file-description" title=3D"Female katip=C5=8D"><i=
mg alt=3D"Female katip=C5=8D" src=3D"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia=
/commons/thumb/8/86/Katip%C5%8D%2C_Birdlings_Flat_7591%2C_New_Zealand_impor=
ted_from_iNaturalist_photo_373793836.jpg/250px-Katip%C5%8D%2C_Birdlings_Fla=
