=8D</div></div></div>
<p>The <b><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Katip%C5%8D" title=3D"Ka=
tip=C5=8D">katip=C5=8D</a></b> (<i>Latrodectus katipo</i>) is a species of =
<a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Theridiidae" title=3D"Theridiidae"=
>cobweb spider</a> found only in New Zealand. It inhabits <a href=3D"https:=
//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dune" title=3D"Dune">sand dunes</a> close to the se=
ashore and is found on most of New Zealand's coastline, except for the far =
south and the <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_Coast_Region" t=
itle=3D"West Coast Region">West Coast</a>. In the <a href=3D"https://en.wik=
ipedia.org/wiki/South_Island" title=3D"South Island">South Island</a> and t=
he lower half of the <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/North_Island"=
 title=3D"North Island">North Island</a>, the female has a distinct red str=
ipe bordered in white running down its abdomen <i>(example pictured)</i>; i=
n more northern populations, this stripe is absent or paler. It is most clo=
sely related to the Australian <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Red=
back_spider" title=3D"Redback spider">redback spider</a>. Like the redback,=
 the katip=C5=8D is venomous to humans, with its bite being capable of prod=
ucing the toxic syndrome <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Latrodect=
ism" title=3D"Latrodectism">latrodectism</a>. Bites are very rare and <a hr=
ef=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Antivenom" title=3D"Antivenom">antiveno=
m</a> is available in some hospitals. It mainly feeds on ground-dwelling in=
sects which it catches with an irregular tangled web spun among dune plants=
. Due to habitat loss, colonisation of their natural habitat by <a href=3D"=
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Invasive_species" title=3D"Invasive species">=
invasive</a> spiders and <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hybrid_(b=
iology)" title=3D"Hybrid (biology)">hybridisation</a> with the redback spid=
er, the katip=C5=8D population is regarded as declining. <i>(<b><a href=3D"=
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Katip%C5%8D" title=3D"Katip=C5=8D">Full&#160;=
article...</a></b>)</i>
</p>
