<p><b>May 6</b>
</p>
<div id=3D"mp-tfa-img" style=3D"float: left; margin: 0.5em 0.9em 0.4em 0em;=
">
<div class=3D"thumbinner mp-thumb" style=3D"background: transparent; color:=
 inherit; border: none; padding: 0; max-width: 140px;">
<span typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Joaq=
uin_2015-10-03_1437Z.png" class=3D"mw-file-description" title=3D"Joaquin at=
 peak intensity near the Bahamas"><img alt=3D"Joaquin at peak intensity nea=
r the Bahamas" src=3D"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/=
0/0b/Joaquin_2015-10-03_1437Z.png/250px-Joaquin_2015-10-03_1437Z.png" decod=
ing=3D"async" width=3D"140" height=3D"140" class=3D"mw-file-element" data-f=
ile-width=3D"1600" data-file-height=3D"1600"></a></span><div class=3D"thumb=
caption" style=3D"padding: 0.25em 0; word-wrap: break-word;">Joaquin at pea=
k intensity near the Bahamas</div></div></div>
<p><b><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hurricane_Joaquin" title=3D"=
Hurricane Joaquin">Hurricane Joaquin</a></b> was a powerful <a href=3D"http=
s://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tropical_cyclone" title=3D"Tropical cyclone">trop=
ical cyclone</a> in 2015 and one of the strongest hurricanes on record to a=
ffect the Bahamas. It evolved from a <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wi=
ki/Cold-core_low" title=3D"Cold-core low">non-tropical low</a> to a <a href=
=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tropical_cyclone#Classification" title=3D=
"Tropical cyclone">tropical depression</a>, becoming a Category&#160;4 majo=
r hurricane on the <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saffir%E2%80%93=
Simpson_scale" title=3D"Saffir=E2=80=93Simpson scale">Saffir=E2=80=93Simpso=
n scale</a> on October&#160;1. On October&#160;3, Joaquin acquired <a href=
=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maximum_sustained_wind" title=3D"Maximum =
sustained wind">sustained winds</a> of 155&#160;mph (250&#160;km/h). Betwee=
n October&#160;1 and 3, it caused extensive damage on <a href=3D"https://en=
.wikipedia.org/wiki/Acklins" title=3D"Acklins">Acklins</a>, <a href=3D"http=
s://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Crooked_Island,_Bahamas" title=3D"Crooked Island,=
 Bahamas">Crooked Island</a>, <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Long=
_Island,_Bahamas" title=3D"Long Island, Bahamas">Long Island</a>, <a href=
=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rum_Cay" title=3D"Rum Cay">Rum Cay</a>, a=
nd <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/San_Salvador_Island" title=3D"S=
an Salvador Island">San Salvador Island</a>. Prolonged, intense winds broug=
ht down trees and power lines, and unroofed homes. Flooding persisted for d=
ays after the hurricane's departure. Relief efforts were hampered by heavy =
damage to airstrips and flooded roads. The <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.=
org/wiki/Turks_and_Caicos_Islands" title=3D"Turks and Caicos Islands">Turks=
 and Caicos Islands</a>, Cuba, and Haiti were all severely affected. Over t=
he Southeastern United States, <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oct=
ober_2015_North_American_storm_complex" title=3D"October 2015 North America=
n storm complex">a separate storm system</a> drew tremendous moisture from =
the hurricane, leading to catastrophic flooding in <a href=3D"https://en.wi=
kipedia.org/wiki/South_Carolina" title=3D"South Carolina">South Carolina</a=
>. Over its lifetime, Joaquin killed 34 people and caused US$120&#160;milli=
on in damage. <i>(<b><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hurricane_Joa=
quin" title=3D"Hurricane Joaquin">Full&#160;article...</a></b>)</i>
</p>
