<div class=3D"thumbinner mp-thumb" style=3D"background: transparent; color:=
 inherit; border: none; padding: 0; max-width: 118px;">
<span typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Trug=
anini_-_Charles_Woolley_(cropped).jpg" class=3D"mw-file-description"><img s=
rc=3D"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Truganini_-=
_Charles_Woolley_%28cropped%29.jpg/120px-Truganini_-_Charles_Woolley_%28cro=
pped%29.jpg" decoding=3D"async" width=3D"118" height=3D"165" class=3D"mw-fi=
