>Ben&amp;Ben</a></b> are a Filipino indie <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.o=
rg/wiki/Folk-pop" title=3D"Folk-pop">folk-pop</a> band from <a href=3D"http=
s://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manila" title=3D"Manila">Manila</a>. They were fo=
rmed in 2016 by twin brothers Paolo and Miguel Benjamin Guico (lead vocals =
and acoustic guitars), calling themselves the Benjamins. A year later, they=
 expanded into an ensemble and settled on the current name, adding Poch Bar=
retto (electric guitar), Keifer Cabugao (violin), Patricia Lasaten (keyboar=
ds), Toni Mu=C3=B1oz (percussion), Andrew de Pano (percussion), Agnes Reoma=
 (bass guitar), and Jam Villanueva (drums). The band's musical style has ga=
rnered praise for its anthemic quality and emotional engagement that appeal=
s to a broad audience, while their lyrics focus on subjects including loss,=
 heartbreak and relationship, and the journey towards self-love. <a href=3D=
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_awards_and_nominations_received_by_B=
en%26Ben" title=3D"List of awards and nominations received by Ben&Ben">Ben&=
amp;Ben have received numerous accolades</a>, including an <a href=3D"https=
://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Asia_Artist_Awards" title=3D"Asia Artist Awards">A=
sia Artist Award</a>, an <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aliw_Awar=
ds" title=3D"Aliw Awards">Aliw Award</a>, a <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia=
.org/wiki/NME_Awards" title=3D"NME Awards"><i>NME</i> Award</a>, two <a hre=
f=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Myx_Music_Awards" title=3D"Myx Music Awa=
rds">Myx Music Awards</a>, three <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/P=
MPC_Star_Awards_for_Movies" title=3D"PMPC Star Awards for Movies">Star Awar=
ds</a>, and sixteen <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Awit_Awards" t=
itle=3D"Awit Awards">Awit Awards</a>. In 2020, they placed 29th on the <a h=
ref=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Billboard_Social_50_number-one=
_artists" title=3D"List of Billboard Social 50 number-one artists"><i>Billb=
oard</i> Social&#160;50</a> chart. <i>(<b><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.o=
rg/wiki/Ben%26Ben" title=3D"Ben&Ben">This&#160;article</a></b> is part of a=
 <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Featured_topics" title=
