<p>"<b><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Running_Out_of_Time_(song)"=
 title=3D"Running Out of Time (song)">Running Out of Time</a></b>" is a son=
g by the American rock band <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paramo=
re" title=3D"Paramore">Paramore</a> <i>(pictured)</i>. It was released on M=
ay&#160;23, 2023, by <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atlantic_Reco=
rds" title=3D"Atlantic Records">Atlantic Records</a> as the fourth single f=
rom the band's sixth studio album <i><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wi=
ki/This_Is_Why" title=3D"This Is Why">This Is Why</a></i> (2023). <a href=
=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hayley_Williams" title=3D"Hayley Williams=
">Hayley Williams</a>, <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taylor_York=
" title=3D"Taylor York">Taylor York</a>, and <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedi=
a.org/wiki/Zac_Farro" title=3D"Zac Farro">Zac Farro</a> wrote the song in t=
he early stages of the album's production, and <a href=3D"https://en.wikipe=
dia.org/wiki/Carlos_de_la_Garza_(music_producer)" title=3D"Carlos de la Gar=
za (music producer)">Carlos de la Garza</a> produced it. The band premiered=
 the song at a concert at the <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gran=
d_Ole_Opry" title=3D"Grand Ole Opry">Grand Ole Opry</a> on February&#160;7,=
 2023, and performed it on <i><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jimm=
y_Kimmel_Live!" title=3D"Jimmy Kimmel Live!">Jimmy Kimmel Live!</a></i> on =
February&#160;14. Described by critics as a <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia=
.org/wiki/Pop_rock" title=3D"Pop rock">pop-rock</a> and <a href=3D"https://=
en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dance-rock" title=3D"Dance-rock">dance-rock</a> song,=
 "Running Out of Time" deals with time management and comments on social an=
xieties over death, aging, and losing friends. Williams said the song was i=
nfluenced by her personal struggle with punctuality and her friendship with=
 <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taylor_Swift" title=3D"Taylor Swi=
ft">Taylor Swift</a>. Critics positively reviewed the song, praising its ly=
rics as playful and its composition as well-balanced. The song peaked on se=
veral international charts in 2023 and ranked on <i>Billboard</i><span clas=
s=3D"nowrap" style=3D"padding-left:0.1em;">'s</span> year-end <a href=3D"ht=
tps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alternative_Airplay" title=3D"Alternative Airpl=
ay">Alternative Airplay</a> chart. <i>(<b><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.o=
rg/wiki/Running_Out_of_Time_(song)" title=3D"Running Out of Time (song)">Fu=
ll&#160;article...</a></b>)</i>
</p>
