/en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kamila_Valieva" title=3D"Kamila Valieva">Kamila Vali=
eva</a> of Russia. After nearly two years of litigation, Valieva's scores w=
ere stricken and the newly tabulated results placed the American team first=
, the Japanese team second, and the Russian team third. The American and Ja=
panese teams received their medals at a ceremony held at the <a href=3D"htt=
ps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jardins_du_Trocad%C3%A9ro" title=3D"Jardins du T=
rocad=C3=A9ro">Jardins du Trocad=C3=A9ro</a> in <a href=3D"https://en.wikip=
edia.org/wiki/Paris" title=3D"Paris">Paris</a> during the <a href=3D"https:=
//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2024_Summer_Olympics" title=3D"2024 Summer Olympics=
