ord-wrap: break-word;">Jewish head coverings called <span title=3D"Hebrew-l=
anguage text"><i lang=3D"he-Latn">kippot</i></span></div></div></div>
<p><i><b><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Menora_v._Illinois_High_S=
chool_Association" title=3D"Menora v. Illinois High School Association">Men=
ora v. Illinois High School Association</a></b></i> is a case heard by the =
<a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States_Court_of_Appeals_for=
_the_Seventh_Circuit" title=3D"United States Court of Appeals for the Seven=
th Circuit">U.S. Court of Appeals for the Seventh Circuit</a> which centere=
d on two <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jewish_day_school" title=
=3D"Jewish day school">Jewish schools</a> which sued the <a href=3D"https:/=
/en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Illinois_High_School_Association" title=3D"Illinois =
High School Association">Illinois High School Association</a> (IHSA) when t=
he IHSA would not let them compete in a basketball tournament unless studen=
t-athletes removed their <span title=3D"Hebrew-language text"><i lang=3D"he=
-Latn"><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kippah" title=3D"Kippah">ki=
ppot</a></i></span> <i>(examples pictured)</i> from their heads during play=
. The schools argued that their <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fi=
rst_Amendment_to_the_United_States_Constitution" title=3D"First Amendment t=
o the United States Constitution">First Amendment</a> right of <a href=3D"h=
ttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Freedom_of_religion_in_the_United_States" titl=
e=3D"Freedom of religion in the United States">freedom of religion</a> was =
violated. The IHSA stated that banning the <span title=3D"Hebrew-language t=
ext"><i lang=3D"he-Latn">kippot</i></span> was reasonable because they coul=
d fall off during play, risking player injury. The Seventh Circuit held tha=
t no conflict would exist if the schools designed a head covering that was =
not a safety risk. The case was settled in June&#160;1983, allowing <span t=
itle=3D"Hebrew-language text"><i lang=3D"he-Latn">kippot</i></span> to be w=
