<span typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Sall=
y_Ride_(1984).jpg" class=3D"mw-file-description" title=3D"Sally Ride"><img =
alt=3D"Sally Ride" src=3D"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/th=
umb/0/0c/Sally_Ride_%281984%29.jpg/250px-Sally_Ride_%281984%29.jpg" decodin=
