"></a></span></div></div>
<p>The <b><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Serpent_labret_with_arti=
culated_tongue" title=3D"Serpent labret with articulated tongue">serpent la=
bret with articulated tongue</a></b> is a gold-alloy <a href=3D"https://en.=
wikipedia.org/wiki/Body_piercing_jewelry" title=3D"Body piercing jewelry">b=
ody ornament</a> from the <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aztecs" =
title=3D"Aztecs">Aztec</a> culture of the mid-second millennium. Designed t=
o be inserted into a piercing below the lower lip, it depicts a fanged serp=
ent poised to strike, with a bifurcated tongue hanging from its mouth. The =
tongue, which is moveable and retractable <i>(animation pictured)</i>, woul=
d have swung from side to side with its wearer's movements. Art historians =
have described it as among the finest of the fewer than 400 Aztec gold obje=
cts known to survive. The labret is 6.7&#160;cm (2.6&#160;in) high, 6.7&#16=
0;cm (2.6&#160;in) long, and weighs 51 grams (1.81&#160;oz). Consisting of =
a gold, copper, and silver alloy, it was made by <a href=3D"https://en.wiki=
pedia.org/wiki/Lost-wax_casting" title=3D"Lost-wax casting">lost-wax castin=
g</a>. <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Labret" title=3D"Labret">La=
brets</a>, or lip plugs, were associated with eloquence and nobility in Azt=
ec culture, while gold was a hallmark of divinity. The serpent may represen=
t <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xiuhc%C5%8D%C4%81tl" title=3D"Xi=
uhc=C5=8D=C4=81tl">Xiuhc=C5=8D=C4=81tl</a>, the fire serpent wielded as a w=
eapon by the sun god <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hu%C4%ABtzil%=
C5%8Dp%C5%8Dchtli" title=3D"Hu=C4=ABtzil=C5=8Dp=C5=8Dchtli">Hu=C4=ABtzil=C5=
=8Dp=C5=8Dchtli</a>. The labret was purchased in 2016 by the <a href=3D"htt=
ps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Metropolitan_Museum_of_Art" title=3D"Metropolita=
n Museum of Art">Metropolitan Museum of Art</a>. <i>(<b><a href=3D"https://=
en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Serpent_labret_with_articulated_tongue" title=3D"Serp=
ent labret with articulated tongue">Full&#160;article...</a></b>)</i>
</p>
